      "record": {
        "id": "a-start-statistic-samples-model-calls-not-debits",
        "statement": "The start statistics of a cost kind are taken over its model calls, not over its debits: a gateway-measured event that lists its calls in call_usd_micros contributes one sample per call, and any other gateway-measured event contributes one sample. A list, when present, holds two or more non-negative costs that sum to the event's usd_micros, and only on a gateway-measured event; a charge that would break this is refused as invalid.",
        "contexts": [
          "credit"
        ],
        "examples": [
          "One batch reflection debit of 6000 micros listing calls of 1000, 2000 and 3000, beside a single-call event of 4000, is four samples with p50 2500 and p95 3850.",
          "Four single-call creation_step events of 100, 200, 300 and 400 micros are four samples with p95 385, the same as before calls were listed.",
          "A list of one call, calls summing to 29 of a 30-micro debit, or calls on an estimated event are refused."
        ],
